    "subHeader": "Launch your SVG company with Arnifi. Benefit from a flexible offshore jurisdiction built for international business and global expansion.\n",
    "blogs": [],
    "overviewDetail": "SVG is a well-established offshore jurisdiction offering a flexible, tax-efficient environment for international businesses, holding companies, trading entities, and asset protection structures. Its straightforward incorporation process and business-friendly legislation have made it a preferred destination for entrepreneurs and international investors seeking efficient cross-border operations.\nThe jurisdiction allows 100% foreign ownership and offers several corporate structures designed for international activities. Businesses benefit from minimal local operational requirements, efficient registration procedures, and a legal framework based on English common law principles.\n\nThe Financial Services Authority (FSA) regulates the non-bank financial services sector while ensuring compliance with international standards relating to anti-money laundering, transparency, and beneficial ownership. Recent regulatory developments continue strengthening SVG's international reputation while maintaining a competitive offshore business environment.\n\nCombining operational flexibility, tax efficiency, straightforward incorporation, and evolving regulatory standards, Saint Vincent and the Grenadines remains a practical choice for international business structuring.\n",
