        "id": 109,
        "question": "Why do businesses choose Saint Vincent and the Grenadines?\n",
        "answer": "SVG offers tax efficiency, flexible company structures, quick incorporation, and cost-effective offshore business solutions.\n"
      },
      {
        "id": 110,
        "question": "What company types can be established in SVG?\n",
        "answer": "Businesses commonly establish International Business Companies (IBCs), LLCs, trusts, and foundations."
      },
      {
        "id": 111,
        "question": "Who regulates financial services in SVG?\n",
        "answer": "The Financial Services Authority (FSA) supervises the country's non-bank financial services sector.\n"
      },
      {
        "id": 112,
        "question": "Can foreigners own a company in SVG?\n",
        "answer": "Yes. Foreign investors can own 100% of an offshore company without local ownership requirements.\n"
